[*]
[*] chi_to_bow_bridge -- curated GTKWave layout (top-level DUT interface)
[*] Signals grouped by function: clock/reset, CHI request, CHI response,
[*] BoW TX/RX, and debug/error counters. Open via `make gtkwave` (test/Makefile),
[*] or manually: gtkwave sim_build/chi_to_bow_bridge.fst -a chi_to_bow_bridge.gtkw
